{"seq":3,"slug":"fpga-introduction","title":"FPGA 入门","stage":"DONE","category":"hardware-electronics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction","rating":{"composite":3.97,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.08,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introMarkdown":"# FPGA 入门\n\nFPGA（Field-Programmable Gate Array，现场可编程门阵列）是一种可在制造后通过编程重新配置的半导体器件，其内部包含数千到数百万个可配置逻辑块，能够实现任意数字电路。与按顺序执行指令的 CPU 不同，FPGA 通过物理重构自身成为你所设计的硬件，从而实现大规模并行处理和确定性纳秒级延迟。\n\n本 Hub 面向零基础学习者，系统介绍 FPGA 从架构原理到开发实践再到应用场景的完整知识体系。截至 2025 年，全球 FPGA 市场规模已达约 110 亿美元，预计 2030 年将超过 180 亿美元，主要受 AI 推理加速、5G 基础设施和 IoT 边缘计算三大力量驱动。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n本 Hub 划分为四个章节，建议按顺序学习：\n\n1. **FPGA 架构** — 理解 FPGA 内部核心组件（CLB、IOB、互联网络）以及片上硬核资源\n2. **HDL 编程** — 掌握 Verilog 硬件描述语言的基础语法与设计范式\n3. **FPGA 开发流程** — 学习从 RTL 编码到比特流生成的完整工程流程\n4. **FPGA 应用** — 了解 FPGA 在数字信号处理、通信协议和 AI 推理加速中的典型应用\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 数字电路基础（布尔代数、逻辑门、触发器）\n- 基本的二进制与数制转换概念\n- 了解时钟信号与时序的基本含义\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fpga-architecture","title":"FPGA 架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fpga-internal-structure","title":"FPGA 内部结构详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-architecture/fpga-internal-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lut-carry-chain","title":"查找表与进位链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-architecture/lut-carry-chain"},{"seq":3,"slug":"on-chip-resources","title":"片上资源详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-architecture/on-chip-resources"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"hdl-programming","title":"HDL 编程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/hdl-programming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"verilog-basics","title":"Verilog 基础语法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/hdl-programming/verilog-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"combinational-sequential-description","title":"组合与时序逻辑描述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/hdl-programming/combinational-sequential-description"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modular-parameterized-design","title":"模块化与参数化设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/hdl-programming/modular-parameterized-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"fpga-development-flow","title":"FPGA 开发流程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"synthesis-implementation","title":"综合与实现流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow/synthesis-implementation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"constraint-files","title":"约束文件编写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow/constraint-files"},{"seq":3,"slug":"simulation-timing-analysis","title":"仿真与时序分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-development-flow/simulation-timing-analysis"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"fpga-applications","title":"FPGA 应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dsp-acceleration","title":"数字信号处理加速","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-applications/dsp-acceleration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"communication-protocol-implementation","title":"通信协议实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-applications/communication-protocol-implementation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-inference-accelerator","title":"AI 推理加速器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-applications/ai-inference-accelerator"}]}]}